 going to cut a slice of pineapple  for our pineapple decor the traditional  daiquiri the strawberry daiquiri  and the pineapple daiquiri one drink  three variations but there are endless  ways you can customize this drink  if you add mint to it put it in a tall  glass with some soda it's a mojito  you're pretty much just limited by the  contents of your kitchen and your  imagination  if you like that recipe tell us some of  your favorite drinks you like to make at  home in the comments below and subscribe  to the gq channel we've got lots more of  [Music]  them
 

